      <transcript>ZIBXULANGTU</transcript>
      <definition>[= zibxulangtai] adj. and n. Magnificent, majestic, splendid, grand; powerful, mighty. Name of the city formerly known as Ulijasutai (administrative center of Dzabkhan aimak).</definition>
